# Convert Rocky10 to RHEL10




Download rhel10 dvd iso, mount it and copy "RPM-GPG-KEY-redhat-release" and  "BaseOS/Packages/redhat-release-10*.rpm" file from the ISO

Then do the following :
# dnf install -y subscription-manager 
# rpmkeys --import RPM-GPG-KEY-redhat-release
# rpm -ivh --replacepkgs --nodeps redhat-release-10*.rpm
# rpm -e --nodeps rocky-release rocky-repos rocky-gpg-keys 2>/dev/null || true
# subscription-manager register --org xxxxx --activationkey xxxx
# dnf clean all
# dnf distro-sync -y --allowerasing
# dnf reinstall -y kernel
# reboot
